From: cheatoskar <140116603+cheatoskar@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 15:22:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 16/28] fvlab: window (from, to) edge fix, FVLAB_KICK_STALL,
 nosepos objective, FVLAB_NOSE_ROLL

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KM4cBXAuR6N7ACvaCZmUaz
---
 tools/fvlab.cpp | 81 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 1 file changed, 70 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/fvlab.cpp b/tools/fvlab.cpp
index 3500e2d..7f7a98c 100644
--- a/tools/fvlab.cpp
+++ b/tools/fvlab.cpp
@@ -205,7 +205,8 @@ int main(int argc, char **argv) {
